# Modals

## Rules

- The modal must appear above the page content with a dark overlay.
- The overlay must cover the whole window.
- The content behind the modal must remain visually dimmed.
- The modal must have a clearly identifiable close button.
- The close button must be placed at the top right.
- The primary actions must be placed at the bottom of the modal, aligned to the right.
- The primary action uses the primary color of the design system (solid blue, white text).
- The secondary action remains a simple text link, without background or border.
- The buttons must reuse the existing `ClickableButton` component (exported from `components/ui/index.ts`).

